Fix a bug in which cross-validation and hyperparameter tuning with the default scoring gave NaN scores for some models, such as ``bagging`` and ``stacking``, due to a scikit-learn bug with metadata routing (scikit-learn/scikit-learn#35195). Using a scikit-learn :class:`~sklearn.pipeline.Pipeline` affected by this bug inside julearn now raises an error `Fede Raimondo`_
